#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:44
msgid "Newlines and comments"
msgstr "换行与注释"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:45
msgid ""
"Group class names the way you think about them, annotate the groups, and "
"let the compiler fold it all into one string."
msgstr "按你思考的方式给类名分组、给每组加注释，剩下的交给编译器折成一个字符串。"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:48
msgid "Nothing left at runtime"
msgstr "运行时什么都不剩"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:49
msgid ""
"A static template becomes a string literal. A static tw template has its "
"tailwind-merge resolved at build time too."
msgstr "静态模板会变成字符串字面量；静态的 tw 模板连 tailwind-merge 都在编译期算完。"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:52
msgid "Works without the plugin"
msgstr "没装插件也能跑"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:53
msgid ""
"The macro entry exports the real runtime, so tests and scripts keep "
"working. Only the cost differs."
msgstr "macro 入口导出的就是真实运行时，测试和脚本照常工作，差的只是开销。"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:56
msgid "Every bundler"
msgstr "所有打包器"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:57
msgid ""
"Vite, Rollup, Rolldown, webpack, Rspack, esbuild and Farm through unplugin "
"— and Turbopack through its own loader."
msgstr ""
"Vite、Rollup、Rolldown、webpack、Rspack、esbuild 和 Farm 走 unplugin，Turbopack "
"走它自己的 loader。"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:78
#: src/app/[locale]/layout.tsx:20
msgid ""
"Write long Tailwind class names across several lines, with comments, and "
"pay nothing for it at runtime."
msgstr "把长长的 Tailwind 类名分行写、加注释，运行时一分钱不花。"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:91
msgid "Get started"
msgstr "开始使用"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:102
msgid "What you write"
msgstr "你写的"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:103
msgid "What ships"
msgstr "真正发布的"

#: src/app/[locale]/(home)/page.tsx:138
msgid ""
"This page is built with <TwlRepo>twl</TwlRepo> and "
"<BestI18nRepo>best-i18n</BestI18nRepo>. Every class name on it was folded "
"at build time, and every string above was inlined for this locale."
msgstr ""
"这个页面由 <TwlRepo>twl</TwlRepo> 和 <BestI18nRepo>best-i18n</BestI18nRepo> "
"构建。页面上的每个类名都在编译期折叠完成，上面每句文案也都为当前语言内联好了。"
